<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As I go on, there’s a test:</l><l>Will I all things, dear Lord, detest?</l><l>Will I to “precious” things adhere,</l><l>Yet lose Your presence, Lord, so dear?</l><l>If I’m by pride, ambition, lost,</l><l>Then, Lord, expose me at all cost.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If foll’wing You is at great price,</l><l>What can I give except my life?</l><l>Let me become a sacrifice,</l><l>To live a self-denying life,</l><l>A life that cares for nothing else</l><l>But Christ my all, my universe!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
